{
  "description": "dsh-changes-review-fullscreen 依赖的上游事实：审查标签页的根、工具栏分栏按钮与其 React onClick、review store 的首次分栏默认值，右栏面板的呈现方式读数，以及标签页身份属性。本目录的 check-css.mjs 逐条校验（由 pnpm check:css 触发，不挂在 pnpm build 上）。",
  "checks": [
    {"id":"review-root","plugin":"dsh-changes-review-fullscreen","token":"data-changes-review","paths":["dsh-client-ui-deliverables/lib"],"hint":"审查标签页根元素锚点消失，默认分栏没有作用范围"},
    {"id":"split-tool","plugin":"dsh-changes-review-fullscreen","pattern":"\"data-review-tool\":\\s*[\"'`]split[\"'`]","paths":["dsh-client-ui-deliverables/lib"],"hint":"工具栏分栏按钮锚点消失，本插件无从切换默认分栏"},
    {"id":"split-handler","plugin":"dsh-changes-review-fullscreen","pattern":"onClick:\\(\\)=>\\{actions\\.toggledSplit\\(tab\\.id\\)\\}","paths":["dsh-client-ui-deliverables/lib"],"hint":"分栏按钮的 onClick 不再调用 actions.toggledSplit(tab.id)：fiber 上取到的 handler 可能不再写 review store"},
    {"id":"split-pressed","plugin":"dsh-changes-review-fullscreen","pattern":"\"aria-pressed\":split","paths":["dsh-client-ui-deliverables/lib"],"hint":"分栏按钮不再用 aria-pressed 反映 split 状态，本插件无法判断默认值是否已经生效"},
    {"id":"split-default","plugin":"dsh-changes-review-fullscreen","pattern":"split:\\s*true,\\s*wrap:\\s*false","paths":["dsh-client-ui-deliverables/lib"],"hint":"review store 的首次 seed 不再默认 split:true；上游可能已改默认值，本插件“等 seed 后再切单栏”的前提失效"},
    {"id":"panel-mode","plugin":"dsh-changes-review-fullscreen","token":"data-sidebar-right-panel","paths":["dsh-client-ui-sidebar-right/lib"],"hint":"右栏呈现方式标记消失：读不到 push / fullscreen，默认分栏退化为不动作"},
    {"id":"panel-values","plugin":"dsh-changes-review-fullscreen","pattern":"data-sidebar-right-panel\":fullscreen\\?","paths":["dsh-client-ui-sidebar-right/lib"],"hint":"面板标记不再同时输出 fullscreen / push 两个值：本插件无法判断当前是不是全屏"},
    {"id":"tab-occurrence","plugin":"dsh-changes-review-fullscreen","token":"data-sidebar-right-occurrence","paths":["dsh-client-ui-sidebar-right/lib"],"hint":"标签页占位实例锚点消失，本插件退回会话 id + 标签页 id，跨会话去重可能失真"},
    {"id":"tab-id","plugin":"dsh-changes-review-fullscreen","token":"data-sidebar-right-tab","paths":["dsh-client-ui-sidebar-right/lib"],"hint":"标签页 id 锚点消失，身份回退失效"},
    {"id":"session-id","plugin":"dsh-changes-review-fullscreen","token":"data-sidebar-right-session","paths":["dsh-client-ui-sidebar-right/lib"],"hint":"会话 id 锚点消失，回退身份无法区分不同会话的同名标签页"}
  ]
}
